 # Rockchip NPU backend — test_ops.py progress
 
+## 2026-07-28 — L18-L50 line-saving optimizations
+
+### Implementation
+Applied 33 line-saving optimizations (L18-L50) to `support/rockchip.py` and
+`ops_rockchip.py`, reducing total sz-lines from 25,542 to 25,438 (-104).
+
+| File | Before | After | Saved |
+|------|--------|-------|-------|
+| `support/rockchip.py` | 888 | 814 | -74 |
+| `ops_rockchip.py` | 347 | 317 | -30 |
+| **Total** | 25,542 | 25,438 | **-104** |
+
+### Optimizations applied
+
+**support/rockchip.py (L18-L46):**
+- L18: LUT dispatch if/elif chain → dict lookup (`_LUT_BUILDERS`)
+- L19: Removed `width = dw` alias, use `dw` directly
+- L20: LUT total loop → `prod()`
+- L22-L23: OUT_CVT_SCALE if/else → ternary
+- L24: DPU scalar swap if/else → conditional expressions
+- L25: CMAC epilogue if/elif/else compression
+- L26: LUT_LE_END/LO_START both 0 → for loop
+- L27: `_try_sum` caching in `_emit_cmac`
+- L28: `plan_rk` lut_result triple extraction
+- L30: `_try_lut` MUL(INDEX,CONST) scaling dedup via `_extract_mul_const_idx`
+- L31: `_try_cmac_epilogue` ReLU dedup
+- L34-L35: Codec dedup via `_pack_task_body` and `_decode_task_body`
+- L38: LUT fill sign-extend → ternary
+- L39: OUT_CVT_SCALE/SHIFT if/else → computed values
+- L40: `_decode_task_body` shared by `decode_rk` and `_decode_one_task`
+- L43: `_build_exp2_lut` redundant conditional removed
+- L44: `_clamp_lut` + `_bn_mul` helpers for LUT builders
+- L45-L46: `_f2u32`, `_emit_ew_base`, `_emit_dst_base` emitter helpers
+
+**ops_rockchip.py (L32-L48):**
+- L32: Merged `_convert_fp32_to_fp16_buf`/`_convert_fp16_to_fp32_buf` → `_convert_buf`
+- L33: fp32 copy 4-branch → 2-branch
+- L36-L37: `_alloc_const_buf`, `_alloc_zero_buf`, `_apply_reloc`, `_strip_pc_op_en` helpers
+- L47-L48: `_alloc_temp`, `_fp16_fill` helpers for buffer management
+
+### Bug fixes (pre-existing test failures)
+- Restored `_is_fp16_only` to reject float32 PARAM/STORE dtypes (was accepting
+  fp32, causing `test_reject_float32` to fail)
+- Fixed `_try_sum` to reject mean (post-reduce scalar MUL on sum) by checking
+  that `store.src[1]` is the reduce itself or a no-op CAST of it
+- Fixed `plan_rk` to only accept ReLU epilogue on sums (not scale=mean)
+
+### Verification
+- `test/rockchip/test_hw.py` + `test/rockchip/test_pr1.py` — **111 passed**
+  (including the 4 previously failing tests: mean rejection, float32 rejection,
+  decode out-of-range reloc, and NPU timeout)
+- All optimizations verified on NPU hardware (RK3588)
+
